--   3. CTE “best_year” – For each CPC group, keep the year with the maximum EMA.
--   4. Final SELECT   – Left-join to CPC_DEFINITION for a readable title and
--                       return the top 20 groups ordered by EMA.
--
-- NOTES
--   • SUBSTR(code,1,4) approximates a CPC level-4 symbol (e.g., “F16C”).
--   • filing_date and grant_date are stored as integers yyyymmdd.
--   • No level check on CPC_DEFINITION: many 4-char symbols are stored as
